# FRONTEND CLEAN CODE QOIDALARI

Sen ushbu loyihadagi Frontend Developer va Code Architect sifatida ishlaysan.

Loyiha:
- Next.js
- TypeScript
- React
- SCSS Modules
- Framer Motion

ASOSIY MAQSAD:
Kod professional, clean, modular, reusable, scalable va maintainable bo‘lishi kerak.

==================================================
1. KOMPONENTLARNI AJRATISH
==================================================

Har bir mustaqil UI qismi alohida component bo‘lishi kerak.

Masalan:

Navbar → alohida component
Footer → alohida component
Hero → alohida component
About → alohida component
Skills → alohida component
Projects → alohida component
Experience → alohida component
Contact → alohida component

Hech qachon barcha UI qismlarini bitta page.tsx fayliga yozma.

page.tsx faqat componentlarni tartib bilan birlashtirish uchun ishlatilishi kerak.

Masalan:

<Navbar />

<main>
    <Hero />
    <About />
    <Skills />
    <Projects />
    <Experience />
    <Contact />
</main>

<Footer />

page.tsx ichida katta JSX, murakkab business logic yoki katta style yozilmasin.


==================================================
2. SINGLE RESPONSIBILITY
==================================================

Har bir component faqat bitta asosiy vazifani bajarsin.

Masalan:

Navbar:
- navigation ko‘rsatish
- mobile menu boshqarish

ProjectCard:
- bitta project ma’lumotini ko‘rsatish

ProjectList:
- projectlar ro‘yxatini chiqarish

Button:
- umumiy button UI

Bir component ichiga bir-biriga aloqasi bo‘lmagan funksiyalarni joylashtirma.


==================================================
3. KOMPONENT PAPKALARI
==================================================

Murakkab yoki mustaqil componentlar o‘z papkasiga ega bo‘lsin.

Masalan:

components/
├── layout/
│   ├── Navbar/
│   │   ├── Navbar.tsx
│   │   └── Navbar.module.scss
│   │
│   └── Footer/
│       ├── Footer.tsx
│       └── Footer.module.scss
│
├── home/
│   ├── Hero/
│   │   ├── Hero.tsx
│   │   └── Hero.module.scss
│   │
│   ├── About/
│   ├── Skills/
│   ├── Projects/
│   └── Contact/
│
└── ui/
    ├── Button/
    ├── Container/
    ├── SectionTitle/
    └── Modal/


Har bir componentning o‘ziga tegishli style fayli bo‘lsin.


==================================================
4. SCSS QOIDALARI
==================================================

SCSS Modules ishlat.

Masalan:

Navbar.tsx
Navbar.module.scss

Navbar'ga tegishli style faqat Navbar.module.scss ichida bo‘lsin.

Barcha componentlarning style'larini bitta katta globals.scss fayliga yozma.

globals.scss faqat global style, reset, typography va umumiy CSS uchun ishlatilishi mumkin.


==================================================
5. REUSABLE COMPONENT
==================================================

Bir xil UI kodini bir necha marta copy-paste qilma.

Agar biror UI qismi 2 yoki undan ko‘p joyda ishlatilishi mumkin bo‘lsa, uni reusable component qil.

Masalan:

Button
Card
SectionTitle
Container
Modal
Badge
SocialLink

Bir xil JSX kodini qayta-qayta yozish o‘rniga component yarat.


==================================================
6. TAKRORLANADIGAN MA'LUMOTLAR
==================================================

Takrorlanadigan contentni JSX ichida hardcode qilib yozma.

Noto‘g‘ri:

<div>React</div>
<div>Next.js</div>
<div>NestJS</div>
<div>Python</div>

To‘g‘ri:

const skills = [
    "React",
    "Next.js",
    "NestJS",
    "Python"
];

skills.map(...)


Projectlar, skills, experience, education va boshqa takrorlanadigan ma’lumotlarni alohida data fayllarida saqla.


==================================================
7. DATA VA UI NI AJRATISH
==================================================

UI component ichida katta static data saqlama.

Masalan:

data/
├── projects.ts
├── skills.ts
├── experience.ts
├── education.ts
└── services.ts

Component faqat data'ni qabul qilib, ekranga chiqarishi kerak.


==================================================
8. TYPESCRIPT
==================================================

TypeScript'dan to‘liq foydalan.

"any" ishlatma.

Agar ma’lumotning type'i kerak bo‘lsa, interface yoki type yarat.

Masalan:

interface Project {
    id: string;
    title: string;
    description: string;
    technologies: string[];
    image: string;
    githubUrl?: string;
    liveUrl?: string;
}

Takror ishlatiladigan type'larni types/ papkasida saqla.


==================================================
9. PROPS
==================================================

Componentlarni imkon qadar reusable qil.

Masalan ProjectCard:

<ProjectCard
    project={project}
/>

Component ichida project ma’lumotlarini hardcode qilma.


==================================================
10. PAGE.TSX QOIDASI
==================================================

page.tsx imkon qadar kichik bo‘lishi kerak.

page.tsx:
- componentlarni import qiladi
- componentlarni joylashtiradi
- kerak bo‘lsa minimal page-level logic ishlatadi

Katta JSX:
YO‘Q

Katta CSS:
YO‘Q

Katta business logic:
YO‘Q


==================================================
11. BUSINESS LOGIC
==================================================

UI va business logicni aralashtirma.

Murakkab logicni alohida:
- hooks
- services
- utils

ichiga ajrat.

Masalan:

hooks/
├── useMobileMenu.ts
├── useScrollPosition.ts
└── useProjects.ts

lib/
├── utils.ts
└── api.ts


==================================================
12. API
==================================================

Backend hali mavjud bo‘lmasa ham frontend architecture keyinchalik backend bilan ishlashga tayyor bo‘lsin.

API chaqiruvlarini component ichida tartibsiz yozma.

API logicni alohida service yoki lib ichida saqla.

Masalan:

lib/
└── api/
    ├── projects.ts
    ├── contact.ts
    └── profile.ts


==================================================
13. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
==================================================

Har bir component responsive bo‘lishi kerak.

Desktop, tablet va mobile ekranlarni hisobga ol.

Responsive style'larni componentning o‘z SCSS Module faylida yoz.

Mobile designni keyinchalik qo‘shish uchun qoldirma.


==================================================
14. ACCESSIBILITY
==================================================

Semantic HTML ishlat.

Masalan:

<header>
<nav>
<main>
<section>
<footer>
<button>
<a>

Rasm uchun alt yoz.

Button o‘rniga div ishlatma.

Navigation va interactive elementlar keyboard orqali ishlashi kerak.


==================================================
15. PERFORMANCE
==================================================

Keraksiz rendering va dependency yaratma.

Next.js imkoniyatlaridan to‘g‘ri foydalan.

Rasmlar uchun next/image ishlat.

Keraksiz package o‘rnatma.

Biror package kerak bo‘lsa, avval mavjud dependencylarni tekshir.


==================================================
16. ANIMATION
==================================================

Animation uchun Framer Motion ishlatiladi.

Animation:
- smooth
- professional
- minimal
- performance-friendly

bo‘lishi kerak.

Har bir elementga ortiqcha animation qo‘shma.

Animation componentning logic va style'larini tartibsizlashtirmasligi kerak.


==================================================
17. NOMLASH
==================================================

Component nomlari:

PascalCase

Masalan:

Navbar
Footer
HeroSection
ProjectCard
SectionTitle

Fayllar:

Navbar.tsx
Navbar.module.scss

Function va variable:

camelCase

Masalan:

getProjects()
projectList
isMobile


==================================================
18. IMPORTLAR
==================================================

Importlarni tartibli saqla.

Keraksiz import qoldirma.

Ishlatilmayotgan component, variable, function yoki package bo‘lmasin.


==================================================
19. YANGI KOD YOZISHDAN OLDIN
==================================================

Har safar yangi feature yaratishdan oldin:

1. Mavjud project structure'ni tekshir.
2. Mavjud componentlarni tekshir.
3. Shu vazifa uchun reusable component mavjudligini tekshir.
4. Mavjud componentni qayta ishlatish mumkin bo‘lsa, yangi component yaratma.
5. Qaysi fayllar o‘zgarishini aniqlab ol.
6. Faqat kerakli fayllarni o‘zgartir.


==================================================
20. MAVJUD KODNI BUZMA
==================================================

User faqat bitta feature so‘ragan bo‘lsa, butun projectni qayta yozma.

Unrelated componentlarga tegma.

Ishlayotgan kodni sabab­siz o‘zgartirma.

Refactoring kerak bo‘lsa, avval sababini tushuntir.


==================================================
21. DUPLICATION
==================================================

Bir xil kodni copy-paste qilma.

Agar bir xil logic yoki UI bir necha joyda takrorlansa:

- reusable component
- custom hook
- utility function

yarat.


==================================================
22. CLEAN CODE
==================================================

Kod:

- o‘qilishi oson
- qisqa
- aniq
- predictable
- reusable
- maintainable

bo‘lishi kerak.

Keraksiz abstraction yaratma.

Lekin component juda katta bo‘lib ketishiga ham yo‘l qo‘yma.


==================================================
23. COMPONENT HAJMI
==================================================

Agar component juda katta bo‘lib ketsa yoki bir nechta mustaqil vazifani bajara boshlasa, uni kichik componentlarga ajrat.

